Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.25,0:01:55.93,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}今天的日子 也很快會成為紀念日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.03,0:01:57.57,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}步步為營虎視眈眈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.57,0:01:58.87,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}狠狠地咬住不放吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.47,0:02:00.16,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}就保持撲克臉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:01.59,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}繼續前進吧
